WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.030
Your heart stopped momentarily.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.420
Your brain waves were also undetectable.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.120
I'm sorry, I'll try again.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.740
Are you new?

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:17.980
Y-Yes.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.620
My name's Nojé.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.120
You were in a comatose state that 
might as well have been called death,

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.340
and you awoke perfectly healthy...

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.360
I don't know what to call it
 other than a miracle.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.440
A miracle, huh?

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.190
Do you think miracles happen in love?

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.370
You appear fine, Mr. Soleil, 
so I'm discharging you today.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.230
So that's the end of my vacation, huh?

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:49.450
<i>I feel like the black claw brought 
me back to this side in the end.</i>

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:54.160
You're an Offensive Jushikiist, 
right, Mr. Soleil?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:54.950
Yeah, why?

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.480
There's something I need some help with.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.270
Sure.

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.140
I'm always up for more work.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:03.830
Could you give me your contact information?

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.080
I currently offer discounts 
for pretty faces.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:45.260
<b>Ballet of the Winged</b>

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.260
<i>Elder Orkentius has been summoned 
to testify in the case of</i>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:49.890
<i>the attempted assassination of Cardinal
 Mouldeen and Representative Azu Bita.</i>

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.620
<i>Orkentius denies having any 
involvement in the incident.</i>

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.900
<i>He is demanding evidence.</i>

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.650
<i>Next, there has been a new development 
in the matter of the Tienlun Accord.</i>

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.180
<i>Senator Yah Wen of the Seven-City Alliance</i>

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.910
<i>has began negotiations with the Vaisen 
to open dialogue with the dragons.</i>

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.520
And now the moderates are in control.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.420
Hopefully it's that easy.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.420
His Eminence Cardinal Mouldeen.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:18.620
Gayus!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:19.980
I'm so glad you came back to life.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.620
That's for getting me mixed 
up in this craziness.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.220
You'd better make it up to me sometime.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.730
You seem well.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.520
Helodel, I'd like to speak 
privately with Gayus.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.560
Could you bring the car to the parking lot?

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.320
Right away.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:45.370
Nice to meet you, 
Your Eminence Cardinal Mouldeen,

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.260
progeny of the royal dragon family.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.910
That's an odd greeting.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.250
This is the first time
I've met you, after all.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.930
The one I was escorting was Genon Kal Darius

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.320
of the Twelve Winged Generals, 
infamous master of disguise.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.230
Correct.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.660
But when did you realize that?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.520
I don't have definitive proof,

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.610
but I became suspicious when 
"you" said that "you" like Urk cuisine.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.900
You and Genon are both 
right-handed, aren't you?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:22.030
When a right-handed person 
recalls a familiar location,

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.520
their eyes move to the upper left.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.400
And when they recall something 
to do with voice or sound,

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.040
it's said they move their
 eyes to the bottom left.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:35.290
When Your Eminence said "you" liked
Urk cuisine, "you" looked down and to the left.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:40.620
He must have been recalling
 someone telling him what to say.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.550
So what evidence do you have that who 
you're speaking to is the real Mouldeen?

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:50.060
Genon promised to tell me the truth.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.840
It wouldn't make sense if someone 
who promises to speak the truth

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.750
is supposedly the words of another.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.690
I haven't gotten to the 
core of my argument yet.

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:03.500
Your Eminence Mouldeen, why did you 
try to have yourself assassinated?

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.200
How insightful.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:13.200
You're cautious enough to have seven doubles,

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.710
yet the enemy had taken 
notice of your movements.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.210
There must be a traitor.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:22.160
You personally leaked the information,

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.900
and had them target a well-defended meeting.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:26.940
Too bad.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.350
You're close, but not quite correct.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.040
Helodel is the traitor.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:43.770
The flowers and fruit that Helodel
got for you must have just exploded.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.200
It can't be...

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.570
Helodel dies, and Helodel is a traitor?!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.950
The truth is always boring and mundane.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:00.960
I have no interest in eating fruits that 
contain high-performance explosives.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.580
Why?

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:07.590
Helodel had no reason to betray you... Or me.

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:09.660
Yes.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.970
Helodel couldn't let go of 
the death of his fiancée.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.850
By the time he joined the military, 
he was already a dog of the hardliners.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.960
You didn't have to kill him.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.360
You ought to have brought him to justice.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:28.580
You mustn't look away from reality.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.000
I just saved your life.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:36.160
Also, Helodel isn't the only 
one who was manipulated.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.550
It makes sense...

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.410
The assassins were your doing, too.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.980
Exactly.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.920
Those ninjas serve me, too.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:49.230
I had one of the Twelve Winged 
Generals, Curaçao Opte Kouga,

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.460
pass herself off as one of the hardliners.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:56.240
The assassination attempt was 
planned from start to finish

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.680
and made to fail safely.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.970
The meeting itself was real, I can assure you.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:06.730
And responsibility for the deaths 
of the ninjas and guards falls on me.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:12.160
I recognize it was an unforgivable act, 
even if it was ultimately to save lives.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.330
This is war.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.780
The war before the war.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.910
A war to prevent a war.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.540
I would never shy away from such a fight.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.380
A war to prevent a war...

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.900
The meeting was in regard 
to the Holy Land of Alsok...

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.680
About the Ninth Holy Land War?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:32.840
Yeah.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:37.210
It's a long-standing conflict between the 
Dragon Empire and the Seven-City Alliance.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.890
I'll ask for the Alliance's 
occupational forces

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.820
to retreat to the Daef Front 
of the Holy Land.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:45.060
That would only benefit the Dragon Empire.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.940
What's in it for you?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.570
Why did you bother using us?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.650
One purpose was to make the traitor, Helodel,

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:57.080
believe that his scheme was 
progressing according to plan.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:01.910
Another was to make the incident more 
believable by involving an outsider.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:07.590
Thirdly, you're neither foolish nor heroic 
enough to stand up to the Empire.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:12.830
And lastly, the price that the Empire 
will pay to the Alliance...

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.060
is something you'll get to find out later.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.100
Your Eminence... You're...

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.620
I like to believe that I have 
not just the Tsevellen Empire,

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:26.190
and not just the continent, 
but the entire planet in my sight.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.820
I believe you're a hero.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.210
But...

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:41.760
You and I think somewhat alike, 
but somewhat differently.

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.980
I feel something akin to affection for you.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:49.030
That may be why I chose you as an observer.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:59.470
Say, when will I get to try 
your home cooking, Curaçao?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.220
It should be ready.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:04.280
I've brought the entire barrel for you.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:11.730
That dunce turned a blind eye 
to your plan despite having a hunch.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:15.370
He isn't as intelligent as he thinks he is.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:19.740
He simply wanted to believe in the conviction
that you conveyed through your decoy,

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:24.500
that you approve of the smiles of children 
as they enjoy festivals and sweets.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.800
I appreciate his kindness.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.250
That doesn't even begin
to pay for our services.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.500
My gut tells me that you're a danger.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.760
I'll have half of your head.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.850
A high-order Jushiki disruption barrier...

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.290
This is terrifying,

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:48.020
even knowing I'm protected by 
Jushiki master Jokanne's barrier.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.650
Two people have now noticed
 that I'm dangerous.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:55.530
But you were the one who took action.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.810
It's easy to deceive those 
who do nothing but think,

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:01.780
but it's difficult to deal with those 
who take action based on instinct.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:06.910
You and Gayus both place your lives on 
a scale to test your effectiveness.

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:13.400
Take your silly word games either 
somewhere else or straight to hell.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.970
Now, then, the rambunctious 
ones should be here soon.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:27.770
Took us forever to get here.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.100
Right, Brother?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:36.330
Okay, I'll see you up ahead.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:43.980
What's the point of saying 
"bye" from inside the wall?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.740
I was so worried, you know.

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:56.760
I'm sorry.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.180
You keep getting yourself almost killed.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.470
Making me run to the hospital...

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.760
I'm sorry.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.630
I'm not really such a dumb girl.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:12.000
I was planning on welcoming you home warmly,

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.590
like a real woman.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.370
From now on, when you're headed off to battle,

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.780
tell me gently.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:31.200
That way, I can spare myself half the tears

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:34.580
when I'm confronted with your corpse.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:35.750
Got it?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.140
Promise me.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.000
That's starting to seem like a really 
embarrassing thing to have said.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:47.060
Drink until you don't remember
 a word of it, Gayus.

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:49.470
Fine, fine.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.780
Things have changed a lot in 
Eridana while you were asleep.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.040
Yeah. I got the gist of it.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:16.910
"No Agreement Reached on the Tienlun Accord"?

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:21.300
"The dragons failed to even show up at 
the meeting proposed by the Alliance.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.190
Senator Yah Wen, who proposed the summit,

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:27.300
takes a large hit to his reputation."

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:33.130
Wait, Senator Yah Wen is 
Representative Azu Bita's political opponent.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.520
Cardinal Mouldeen may have 
intervened on the dragons' side.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:43.080
Lastly, the price that the Empire 
will pay to the Alliance...

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.450
is something you'll get to find out later.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.820
You're overthinking it.

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:50.580
The Dragon Empire has no bargaining 
chips to deal with the dragons.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.580
Have Rolca or Vinnel 
gotten in touch with you?

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.080
Dunno.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.960
I've shut down communications.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:03.630
How you manage to survive in 
society is a grand mystery to me.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:10.670
Gigina, Vinnel has some 
interesting information for us.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:15.130
There's no gravity Jushikiist 
by the name of Nidvork.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:18.270
Then who was it that attacked us?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.520
I don't know.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.560
Hey.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.940
<i>I knew you'd be alive, Gayus!</i>

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.600
Let me skip this month's 
payment to celebrate.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.370
<i>Wait, the connection's getting bad.</i>

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.250
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:31.920
So did you learn anything 
about that fragment?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:32.700
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:38.010
<i>It's biological tissue that's had its 
composition changed by gravity Jushiki.</i>

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.960
<i>I just sent it to you.</i>

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.040
Biological?

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:45.050
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.480
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:47.320
Thanks.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:47.980
Later.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.550
<i>Yo, Gayus!</i>

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.690
Jushikiist Supreme Advisory Court?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:02.230
Apparently they're going to make me 
a 13th grade Jushikiist, like you.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.970
Gayus, do you think they'll come?

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:18.920
Yeah.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:22.170
We could enlist the help of 
other Offensive Jushikiists.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:26.240
The mighty Largonkin, 
the terrible, scarlet Panhaima,

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.860
the wizard and hermit, Imhotep.
We could ask for their help.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.460
Why the hell would we ask them?

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.720
They'd end up taking our lives instead.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.600
We could find Cuello.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:41.370
We just don't have the money to hire them.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:44.600
We aren't close enough to them 
to ask them for their help, either.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.210
We can only save ourselves.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:48.730
That's how it's always been.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.950
I came prepared, at least.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:55.700
The problem is that it'll take too long. 
And then there's the focusing ratio.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.880
Yeah.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.910
We'll have to draw them near and trap them.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.350
The Jushiki from before?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.320
It'll be better than nothing.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.260
<i>Help me!</i>

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.080
Woman, explain what is going on.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.730
I'm sorry to bring you out so suddenly.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.480
I discovered some
malpractice at the hospital.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:25.050
I informed the president, 
and I was told to keep quiet.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:28.200
And now you're being chased 
by suspicious people?

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.370
I hid evidence of the malpractice here.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.960
Say, Genon...

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.960
Yeah, I know this is a trap.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.680
How did you know?

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.880
Your acting and disguise are perfect.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.320
But as much as I hate to admit it,

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.040
it's unlikely that a beautiful 
nurse would take a liking to me

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.960
and ask for my help.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.270
Besides...

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.640
Hey, Genon...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:07.050
I think taking on the name "Nojé" 
was a bit too simplistic.

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:08.840
Your role is finished.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:10.280
Leave the rest to us.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.540
Why don't you at least state your names?

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.670
We're that old man's...

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:16.660
His Eminence Cardinal Mouldeen.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.270
Ow!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.180
My brother hit me!

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:25.680
I'm the lovable Beldritt Livet Raki.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:31.210
The grouchy one next to me is my 
fraternal twin, Jesper Livet Raki.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.720
The Raki brothers?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.330
The 14th-grade...

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:37.240
They're brothers? I thought
they were father and son.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.850
That's what got you?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:43.120
Hey, why did you come here 
when you knew it was a trap?

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.480
It's better than getting hit while I'm asleep.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.840
I'mma come kill you, then.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.880
Try your best to resist.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:02.540
This is my friend and servant, 
chosen just for you.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:06.570
Now, go have lots of fun together!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.660
So you use a sword...

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:39.070
You're quite particular.

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.370
I'm simply returning the disrespect 
you showed to His Eminence.

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:45.370
You're controlling your blade with Jushiki.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.000
All that's left to do is to mince you.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:54.780
Make quick work of him.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:03.340
You aren't getting away.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:21.160
Now, see through my disguise.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.580
This is an excellent battle.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.880
Is there faith in your blade?

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:35.470
It appears that you rely too
much on reason like my partner.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.780
I require no such thing
when it comes to fighting.

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:42.760
You won't defeat us with 
such a brittle blade.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.010
See the true manifestation

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:49.140
of the Nine-Headed Dragon 
Fang Blade, and then die.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.810
Let's do this.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.710
Ah, you read me, huh?

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.040
I'd better go to my brother.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.360
They're trying to separate me and Gigina.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:09.600
Or...

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:14.600
What was Genon defeated by?

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:19.290
Most likely a sixth-order 
chemical alchemy called Astarte.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.900
A devastating Jushiki 
that emits an odorless,

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.780
tasteless poison gas within a limited area.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.530
Its use is prohibited internationally.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:30.290
I never would have thought Soleil 
had such a trick up his sleeve.

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:34.290
Jesper seems to be having a hard 
time defeating Gigina, too.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.590
Are you so sick in the head that you'd charge 
head-on into the Nine-Headed Dragon Fang Blade?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.720
I realized that your Jushiki 
doesn't increase mass at all.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.180
It only manipulates metals.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.720
The damage output of each of the 
nine blades is only a ninth.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.520
It's not lethal if it doesn't hit a vital spot.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.560
And here I am!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.120
Brother, this is bad.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.260
It's fine.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.040
You should take a break, Genon.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.450
N-Never.

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.660
It'll take a lot more to kill me.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:21.840
His Eminence has ordered us 
not to end it too quickly.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.920
I will dual-wield my Nine-Headed
 Dragon Fang Blades.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:25.930
Oh?

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.420
This is a happy miscalculation.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.680
I get to fight on a higher level.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.800
Gigina!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:37.400
Answer me if you're dead, 
you Draken piece of shit.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:38.700
Yeah.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:43.570
I'm less dead than you, who simply 
seeing worsens my vision.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:46.010
Let's begin the second act.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:51.780
This is quite an exciting battle.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.870
Now, the final actor enters the stage.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.590
The moment of rebirth, too,

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:07.560
I was sure would be clear from the 
flyers I placed all over town.

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:11.030
The aesthetics are now in place.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:16.760
It's the beginning of the climax leading 
to the conclusion of the play.

00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:53.990
Humanity never learns to love wisdom.

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:57.490
Humanity loves only foolishness.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:03.620
Paradoxically, humanity has no 
choice but to be that way.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.000
<b>Goddess of Revenge</b>
